{
  "uid": "truss-vault",
  "title": "Vault \u2014 the applier's credential store",
  "description": "Vault server health, plus what truss can actually read from it. The Vault panels use Vault's documented telemetry names and want verifying against your server once; the bottom row is truss's own.",
  "tags": [
    "vault",
    "truss",
    "secrets"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "timezone": "utc",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Before trusting a panel on this page",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**These queries were written from Vault's documented telemetry names and have not been run against your server.** Vault emits metrics only once `telemetry { prometheus_retention_time = \"...\" disable_hostname = true }` is in its config and the metrics endpoint is readable by the scraper \u2014 either `unauthenticated_metrics_access = true` on the listener, or a scrape carrying a token with `read` on `sys/metrics`.\n\nVerify the names once, from a pod that can reach it:\n\n    curl -s \"$VAULT_ADDR/v1/sys/metrics?format=prometheus\" | grep '^# TYPE'\n\n**Running OpenBao?** Every metric below is `bao_*` rather than `vault_*`. One find-and-replace on this JSON, not a rewrite.\n\nThe bottom row is truss's own view of this vault, and is the part no generic Vault dashboard can give you: what the applier can actually read, and how long its credentials have left."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Is the vault serving?",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Seal state",
      "description": "A sealed vault answers nothing. Everything that reads a credential from it \u2014 including the applier's own expiry sweep \u2014 is down until somebody unseals it.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "vault_core_unsealed",
          "legendFormat": "Seal state",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 42
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "SEALED",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "unsealed",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scrape",
      "description": "Prometheus reaching the metrics endpoint. This going red does not mean the vault is down \u2014 it means this dashboard has stopped being evidence.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 5,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "up{job=~\"vault|openbao\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Scrape",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 42
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "UNREACHABLE",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "reachable",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Audit log failures (1h)",
      "description": "**The one to watch.** Vault refuses a request it cannot write an audit record for. If every audit device is failing, the vault stops serving while remaining unsealed and healthy by every other measure.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 7,
        "x": 10,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(increase(vault_audit_log_request_failure[1h]) + increase(vault_audit_log_response_failure[1h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Audit log failures (1h)",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 42
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active leases",
      "description": "Leases the vault is tracking for expiry. A number that only ever climbs is something creating dynamic credentials and never revoking them.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 7,
        "x": 17,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "vault_expire_num_leases",
          "legendFormat": "Active leases",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 42
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Load and latency",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests handled",
      "description": "Every path, including the applier's own metadata reads. The daily expiry sweep is one burst a day; asking 288 times a day instead is what rate-limited a service account here once.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "rate(vault_core_handle_request_count[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "requests/s",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": null,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Average request latency",
      "description": "Vault's own summary, in milliseconds. A mean rather than a quantile because go-metrics summaries do not expose usable quantiles through this endpoint.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "rate(vault_core_handle_request_sum[5m]) / rate(vault_core_handle_request_count[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "mean latency",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": null,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Logins",
      "description": "The applier authenticates with a projected Kubernetes ServiceAccount JWT on every pass that reads the vault, so this should track the pass cadence. A flat zero while passes are running means the applier is reading its credentials from the mounted mirror and nothing else is dialling in.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "rate(vault_core_handle_login_request_count[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "logins/s",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": null,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Barrier operations",
      "description": "Reads and writes reaching the storage backend through the encryption barrier. Writes on a vault nobody is writing to are worth a look.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 20
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "rate(vault_barrier_get_count[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "get",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "rate(vault_barrier_put_count[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "put",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "rate(vault_barrier_list_count[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "list",
          "refId": "C",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "rate(vault_barrier_delete_count[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "delete",
          "refId": "D",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": null,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens in existence",
      "description": "Requires `usage_gauge_period` in the telemetry stanza; empty without it. Growth with no matching revocation is the shape of a consumer that logs in on every request instead of caching its token.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 20
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "vault_token_count_by_auth",
          "legendFormat": "{{auth_method}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": null,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Vault process health",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory in use",
      "description": "This vault shares a single-node cluster with everything else on the box, so its footprint is somebody else's headroom.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "vault_runtime_alloc_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "allocated",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "vault_runtime_sys_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "reserved from the OS",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": null,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Goroutines",
      "description": "A count that climbs and never falls is a leak, and it precedes the memory graph moving.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "vault_runtime_num_goroutines",
          "legendFormat": "goroutines",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": null,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GC pause",
      "description": "Fraction of wall-clock time spent stopped for garbage collection.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "rate(vault_runtime_gc_pause_ns[5m]) / 1e9",
          "legendFormat": "GC pause fraction",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
